# DADS usage — when to read

Official: https://design.digital.go.jp/dads/ (each component’s usage page)

| When | Usage docs |
|---|---|
| **First** add of a component into `packages/ui` | **Read** (usage / a11y / don’ts). One usage URL line in the PR |
| Layout/copy only with existing `packages/ui` | **Do not read** (Storybook / existing use is source of truth) |
| Stuck on behavior / a11y, or review feedback | **Read** |
| Reading every component’s usage every time | **Forbidden** (excessive) |

Detail (Japanese, human-facing): `frontend/architecture.md` §2.1
